Baseline
Personal recovery / strain / sleep app for the Fitbit Air.

Portions of Core/Google/ (OAuth PKCE flow, Google Health API client, tolerant JSON
extraction, Keychain wrapper) are adapted from Pulse by Luraxx
(https://github.com/Luraxx/pulse), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
See LICENSE-PULSE. Comments were translated to English and the code restructured.
